    "sentence_translations": [
      "When People from the South Say “four” and “ten”",
      "",
      "People from different parts of China usually speak their own dialects and often do not speak Mandarin.",
      "Some southern dialects are so different from Mandarin that people from southern China end up with strong accents when speaking Mandarin.",
      "One typical example is that foreigners who can speak Mandarin can not figure out if they are saying “four” or “ten”.",
      "So it can be better to use gestures when you are shopping."
